# the Throne Room's Where Two Paths Converge (battlefield 161, Bastok 9-2's) with a helper: eve (9-2 completed) in the
# leader's party enters the same area; the listener plays 32004 to both; the leader's finish spawns phase 2, eve's
# finds it up (the bail-out); WON plays 32001 to both; the leader's finish is the mission's (status 2), eve's does
# nothing.
char zone=ThroneRoom pos=-108,-6,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
char eve zone=ThroneRoom pos=-108,-6,0 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=1
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheEmissary completed
mission Bastok TheFourMusketeers completed
mission Bastok ToTheForsakenMines completed
mission Bastok Jeuno completed
mission Bastok Magicite completed
mission Bastok DarknessRising completed
mission Bastok XarcabardLandOfTruths completed
mission Bastok ReturnOfTheTalekeeper completed
mission Bastok ThePiratesCove completed
mission Bastok TheFinalImage completed
mission Bastok OnMyWay completed
mission Bastok TheChainsThatBindUs completed
mission Bastok EnterTheTalekeeper completed
mission Bastok TheSaltOfTheEarth completed
rank 9
mission Bastok WhereTwoPathsConverge current
eve: mission Bastok WhereTwoPathsConverge completed
login
missionstatus Bastok 1
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger _4l1                            # the leader: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=17                  # area 1: registered, entered
finish
eve: trigger _4l1                       # eve (completed): the menu
eve: update 32000 option=17
eve: finish
tick 2000
effect 49                               # a GM: Perfect Dodge
effect 50                               # a GM: Invincible
effect 522                              # a GM: Elemental Sforzo
kill ZEID_BCNM_OFFSET                   # 1 HP; the combat tick: 32004 to both
finish                                  # the leader's 32004: phase 2 spawned
eve: finish                             # eve's 32004: phase 2 up: nothing
tick 2000
kill ZEID_BCNM_OFFSET+1                 # WON
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
tick 2000
finish-if-event                         # 32001, the leader: the mission's finish (battlefieldWin 161): status 2
eve: finish-if-event                    # 32001, eve (completed): nothing from the mission
tick 11000
tick 10000
